{"type":"text","timestamp":1787490927536,"sessionID":"ses_fd13d8cacffehrzmGt11M7KId3","part":{"id":"prt_02ec2f3b20016P72tsWlij3VLS","messageID":"msg_02ec2eea2001hlXEv4hlp2CqtJ","sessionID":"ses_fd13d8cacffehrzmGt11M7KId3","type":"text","text":"\n\n**Root cause:** The filter predicate at `benchmark/fixtures/T2-run-filter/select-comparison-runs.mjs:13-15` joined the three rules with `||`, so a run was kept if *any* rule held (e.g., a failed run with `comparison_eligible !== false` passed).\n\n**Change:** Replaced `||` with `&&` so all three rules must hold. `comparison_eligible !== false` already allows a missing value; `.filter` preserves order, returns original objects, and doesn't mutate the input.\n\n**Test result:** Both tests pass (2 pass, 0 fail).","time":{"start":1787490923442,"end":1787490927534}}}
